## Helm

### Important Concepts

- Chart: Package containing Kubernetes templates and configuration.
- Release: An installed instance of a Helm chart.
- values.yaml: Configuration values used by chart templates.
- Repository: Location where Helm charts are published.
- Templates: Generate Kubernetes manifests from chart configuration.

### Repository Management

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| helm repo add | Add repository |
| helm repo list | List repositories |
| helm repo update | Update repository metadata |
| helm search repo | Search charts |

### Release Management

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| helm install | Install chart |
| helm list -A | List releases |
| helm upgrade | Upgrade release |
| helm rollback | Rollback release |
| helm uninstall | Remove release |
| helm get values | Inspect release configuration |
| helm get manifest | Inspect generated manifests |
| helm template | Render manifests locally |

helm repo add argo https://argoproj.github.io/argo-helm

helm pull argo/argo-cd \
  --version 10.18.0 \
  --untar \
  --untardir charts

helm lint ./charts/argo-cd \
  --values gitops/bootstrap/argocd/values.yaml

helm template argocd ./charts/argo-cd \
  --namespace argocd \
  --values gitops/bootstrap/argocd/values.yaml \
  --include-crds > /tmp/argocd-rendered.yaml

helm upgrade --install argocd ./charts/argo-cd \
  --namespace argocd \
  --create-namespace \
  --values gitops/bootstrap/argocd/values.yaml \
  --wait \
  --timeout 5m

kubectl -n argocd get secret argocd-initial-admin-secret -o jsonpath="{.data.password}" | base64 -d


